    {
      "section_id": "executive_summary",
      "title": "Executive summary",
      "required": true,
      "body_md": "synthetic_pd [A:5c2859d2c12245182829390b010502c17d4be5ca8af39e9560b74f695b3bcdd8#model_name] is a logistic scorecard estimating the probability of default for the portfolio described as: Synthetic credit frame for offline demonstration [A:5c2859d2c12245182829390b010502c17d4be5ca8af39e9560b74f695b3bcdd8#portfolio]. It was developed on 4000 [A:86104f67a1733d3983f9824c7f1bdf9a4cc8bc519d3025f6e40dd115bc978bb1#n_rows] observations with an observed event rate of 0.0935 [A:86104f67a1733d3983f9824c7f1bdf9a4cc8bc519d3025f6e40dd115bc978bb1#target_rate]. It uses 4 [A:c7134ef888cbb778b4cfce879ecda894d06e1b416500a33be3015ffc308ef21c#selected.count] features. Its out-of-time AUC is 0.7373 [A:60b86a70e28738d8209e5f3ef8ff80817f9476b1b9f6fbde57fca555d4bfb966#by_split.oot.auc]. The overall validation outcome is pass [A:86b8f3af768295d1ab7706b31321671c6c4fd86e55a0a59248cd44d48d394f39#overall]. The material limitations are the proxies used for the default event and for origination vintages, described in the limitations section.",
