    {
      "section_id": "purpose_and_use",
      "title": "Model purpose and intended use",
      "required": true,
      "body_md": "The model ranks and quantifies default risk for the portfolio described as: Synthetic credit frame for offline demonstration [A:5c2859d2c12245182829390b010502c17d4be5ca8af39e9560b74f695b3bcdd8#portfolio]. Its intended use is: offline demonstration of the ModelForge pipeline; not for credit decisions [A:5c2859d2c12245182829390b010502c17d4be5ca8af39e9560b74f695b3bcdd8#intended_use]. It predicts the default event over the horizon: five synthetic vintages [A:5c2859d2c12245182829390b010502c17d4be5ca8af39e9560b74f695b3bcdd8#target.horizon]. It is not intended for uses outside that statement, for portfolios other than the one it was developed on, or for decisions the approved conditions exclude.",
