      "section_id": "data",
      "title": "Data",
      "required": true,
      "body_md": "Data quality, leakage and population stability were checked before modelling. After profiling the development data holds 4000 [A:86104f67a1733d3983f9824c7f1bdf9a4cc8bc519d3025f6e40dd115bc978bb1#n_rows] rows and 6 [A:86104f67a1733d3983f9824c7f1bdf9a4cc8bc519d3025f6e40dd115bc978bb1#n_features] candidate features with an event rate of 0.0935 [A:86104f67a1733d3983f9824c7f1bdf9a4cc8bc519d3025f6e40dd115bc978bb1#target_rate]. The leakage screen found 0 [A:15532ea355125d38ca97899014fd256fa0061998b70fa6c5957f08af0823b717#duplicate_rows] duplicate rows and raised 0 [A:15532ea355125d38ca97899014fd256fa0061998b70fa6c5957f08af0823b717#flags.count] leakage flags. The data was split into 2540 [A:56b00c4a6b7a793ab016a68c1284e959dd7156ef2e18ee76cc04630b75e9aa3b#row_ids.train.count] development rows and 635 [A:56b00c4a6b7a793ab016a68c1284e959dd7156ef2e18ee76cc04630b75e9aa3b#row_ids.val.count] validation rows. The out-of-time sample holds 825 [A:56b00c4a6b7a793ab016a68c1284e959dd7156ef2e18ee76cc04630b75e9aa3b#row_ids.oot.count] rows. An out-of-time sample by vintage was available: yes [A:56b00c4a6b7a793ab016a68c1284e959dd7156ef2e18ee76cc04630b75e9aa3b#oot_available].",
