    {
      "section_id": "development",
      "title": "Model development",
      "required": true,
      "body_md": "Features were binned and screened on information value and correlation. The screen selected 4 [A:c7134ef888cbb778b4cfce879ecda894d06e1b416500a33be3015ffc308ef21c#selected.count] features and dropped 2 [A:c7134ef888cbb778b4cfce879ecda894d06e1b416500a33be3015ffc308ef21c#dropped.count]. The final scorecard was estimated with the stepwise_wrong_sign [A:0126114affe7ff4e83d118d167aa01d0331ad9d7b98dd658048bb26ca1d54715#fit_method] procedure on 4 [A:0126114affe7ff4e83d118d167aa01d0331ad9d7b98dd658048bb26ca1d54715#features.count] features. The challenger is a gradient-boosted model of 35 [A:0b50d18229dc1954a1f8ece3bd89d06af91a3a9e8b879d51c8feca216fca68b4#num_trees] trees on the same features. Predicted probabilities were calibrated on the validation split with the platt [A:77acd2d7f2f7e25554ae71c25d65c29388632f72433e7c71ce163e7d47788814#method] method.",
