    {
      "section_id": "performance",
      "title": "Performance and validation results",
      "required": true,
      "body_md": "Discrimination, calibration, stability, sensitivity and the benchmark against the challenger were evaluated against the agreed thresholds. The champion's AUC on the validation sample is 0.7391 [A:60b86a70e28738d8209e5f3ef8ff80817f9476b1b9f6fbde57fca555d4bfb966#by_split.val.auc]. On the out-of-time sample its AUC is 0.7373 [A:60b86a70e28738d8209e5f3ef8ff80817f9476b1b9f6fbde57fca555d4bfb966#by_split.oot.auc] and its KS statistic is 0.3653 [A:60b86a70e28738d8209e5f3ef8ff80817f9476b1b9f6fbde57fca555d4bfb966#by_split.oot.ks]. The out-of-time AUC test outcome is pass [A:86b8f3af768295d1ab7706b31321671c6c4fd86e55a0a59248cd44d48d394f39#tests[disc.auc.oot].status]. The Hosmer-Lemeshow p-value is 0.3574 [A:25460466e948d3502580ab082284a194644760b53b29d3c88053d459ad15e192#hl_p_value]. The per-grade binomial calibration test outcome is pass [A:86b8f3af768295d1ab7706b31321671c6c4fd86e55a0a59248cd44d48d394f39#tests[cal.binomial].status]. The score PSI between the development and out-of-time samples is 0.01558 [A:b3cc8a807028ab71b02ccef435bcbf6bc6d7df2d47b6cf813043d21120517fc3#score_psi]. The champion is within the agreed discrimination gap of the challenger: yes [A:da6161fb21537cafd36f2755c508ffb5ace057d3394f740d6524920c294103b4#champion_within_gap]. The overall validation outcome is pass [A:86b8f3af768295d1ab7706b31321671c6c4fd86e55a0a59248cd44d48d394f39#overall]. The validation test `disc.ks.oot` has outcome pass [A:86b8f3af768295d1ab7706b31321671c6c4fd86e55a0a59248cd44d48d394f39#tests[disc.ks.oot].status]. The validation test `sens.signs` has outcome pass [A:86b8f3af768295d1ab7706b31321671c6c4fd86e55a0a59248cd44d48d394f39#tests[sens.signs].status]. The validation test `sens.monotonic` has outcome pass [A:86b8f3af768295d1ab7706b31321671c6c4fd86e55a0a59248cd44d48d394f39#tests[sens.monotonic].status].",
