    {
      "section_id": "monitoring",
      "title": "Ongoing monitoring plan",
      "required": true,
      "body_md": "Once in use, synthetic_pd [A:5c2859d2c12245182829390b010502c17d4be5ca8af39e9560b74f695b3bcdd8#model_name] is monitored quarterly on discrimination, calibration and population stability of the score and of each feature. It is monitored against the thresholds used at validation, where the overall outcome was pass [A:86b8f3af768295d1ab7706b31321671c6c4fd86e55a0a59248cd44d48d394f39#overall]. A breach of any threshold is escalated to the model owner and triggers a review of whether the model remains fit for its intended use. This revision addresses the reviewer's finding `Monitoring thresholds are not quantified`.",
