      "required": true,
      "body_md": "Every step of the run is recorded in a hash-chained event log, and every input, intermediate result and output is a content-addressed artifact identified by the hash of its bytes, so the lineage from the source data to each reported figure can be verified. The approvals for synthetic_pd [A:5c2859d2c12245182829390b010502c17d4be5ca8af39e9560b74f695b3bcdd8#model_name] are recorded at each human gate. The run can be reproduced and checked against its manifest with modelforge replay.",
